WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
- For all of y'all Jayma, Erinn, Bridgette

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:07.210
be honest who was the bigger
Diva on set Alex or Keanu?

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.930
- I can't answer that until
I know if the movie has been

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.683
locked and if there's a chance
I can still get cut out.

00:00:14.683 --> 00:00:19.683
- She's like wait, no I
have heard though, honestly

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:23.140
that both of y'all are just
such delights to work with.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.920
You're so respectful, you're so kind.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.170
You go out of your way,
that's honestly why I felt

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.080
bold enough to ask the question.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.230
But that's so awesome like
just people that have been in

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:36.240
the business you know done what
you've done in your career.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.050
It's very easy for people to drink

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.840
their own Kool-aide, we
all know those people.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.580
But you still realize you're
not on a different level.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.580
I feel like a lot of people
that gets lost on, do you agree?

00:00:46.816 --> 00:00:47.649
(nervous laughter)

00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:50.520
Oh everyone's afraid, I'm the only one

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.810
not afraid to get fired or something.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.320
- Let's be real, let's be real.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.750
How it was is that we had to brush

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.344
Keanu's hair every day five
times before he went on set.

00:00:59.344 --> 00:01:01.644
We had to give Alex some
hugs, I'm done lying.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.470
- I had a lot of knowing my lines

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.633
and not crying on set, so diva.

